      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I've been going through the merger integration docs from the parent company. Can you run a detailed analysis on the potential efficiency gains and projected cost savings if we migrate all our current Aethelgard workflows over to their standard Llama-derivative architecture? Need to see a comparison of our current architecture vs theirs.",
